From 582365bd9a66a6b7b3a8f42e143b308f32431f51 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 7 Jul 2026 04:59:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: bump vite to ^7 to resolve laravel-vite-plugin peer
 conflict

laravel-vite-plugin ^2.0.0 requires vite ^7, but package.json capped
vite at ^6, so npm ci hit an ERESOLVE conflict during the Docker build.
Regenerate package-lock.json against vite ^7.
